<title>UK: Malaysian Sime Darby to end London listing.</title>
<headline>Malaysian Sime Darby to end London listing.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian conglomerate Sime Darby said on Friday its shares will cease to be listed on the London Stock Exchange with effect from close of business on Friday.</p>
<p>The company said its shares will continue to be listed on the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange in Malaysia.</p>
<p>Sime Darby has not given any reason for its decision to delist from London.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44-171-542 7717</p>
</text>
